    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "4C0E092E1AF37F9D",
      "text": "Kommandiert dich Direktor Cyano vielleicht\\nherum oder stellt er ganz und gar unvernünftige\\r\\nForderungen an dich?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "66926F384EBEA96C",
      "text": "Ach was, es ist alles in Ordnung!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "669272384EBEAE85",
      "text": "Der Direktor ist sehr nett!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "4C0E062E1AF37A84",
      "text": "Verstehe... Dann bin ich ja beruhigt.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "4C0E072E1AF37C37",
      "text": "Direktor Cyano und ich haben dieselbe\\nUniversität besucht.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "4C0E042E1AF3771E",
      "text": "Seither stehe ich komplett unter seiner Fuchtel.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "4C0E052E1AF378D1",
      "text": "Auch, nachdem ich die Stelle als Direktor der\\nAkademie angetreten habe...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "4C0E022E1AF373B8",
      "text": "Da sagte er Dinge wie: „Clavi, du siehst nicht\\nwürdevoll genug aus! Wie wär’s, wenn du dir\\r\\nein paar Premierbälle an die Hüfte hängst?“[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "4C0E032E1AF3756B",
      "text": "Nun ja, ich habe letztendlich auf ihn gehört,\\nda bin ich wohl selbst schuld...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "4C0E002E1AF37052",
      "text": "Wie dem auch sei. Du kannst mir immer Bescheid\\nsagen, falls irgendetwas ist.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "768BFE22D18ABD3B",
      "text": "Seit du dein Austauschstudium an der\\nBlaubeer-Akademie begonnen hast...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "768BFD22D18ABB88",
      "text": "...hat es mich öfter hierher verschlagen.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "768C0022D18AC0A1",
      "text": "Es ist sehr lehrreich, sich andere Schulen\\nanzusehen.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "768BFF22D18ABEEE",
      "text": "Ich möchte einige Aspekte auch bei uns einführen\\nund würde dazu gern deine Meinung erfahren.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "768C0222D18AC407",
      "text": "Was magst du an der Blaubeer-Akademie am\\nliebsten, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "E4D2E8E3718A8F77",
      "text": "Den Schwerpunkt",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "E4D2E9E3718A912A",
      "text": "Den Standort",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "E4D2EAE3718A92DD",
      "text": "Die Ausstattung",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "E4D2E3E3718A86F8",
      "text": "Den Direktor",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "768C0122D18AC254",
      "text": "Mhm, mhm...\\c\\nDie Akademie legt ihren Schwerpunkt auf\\nPokémon-Kämpfe und die Selbstständigkeit\\r\\nihrer Schüler.\\c\\nDas ist also ganz nach deinem Geschmack, wie?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_05b",
      "hash64": "FAA8242A0EC801C2",
      "text": "Mhm, mhm...\\c\\nEine Schule, die auf dem offenen Meer\\nschwimmt, ist in der Tat eindrucksvoll.\\c\\nAber um das bei uns einzuführen, müsste unsere\\nAkademie komplett umziehen...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
